libsodium 1.0.20
----------------
https://github.com/jedisct1/libsodium
ISC licence.

Linked statically into the binaries that terminate cryptography. Taken from the
Alpine package at a pinned version (tools/alpine-packages.txt); Alpine carries a
patch for CVE-2025-69277 and runs the library's own test suite when building the
package.

