LLVM libc++ and libc++abi, musl
-------------------------------
The C++ runtime and the libc the binaries link against statically:
libc++/libc++abi under Apache 2.0 with the LLVM exception, musl under MIT. The
licence texts ship in the Alpine base image under /usr/share/licenses.


